  Result: 11/12 elements within tolerance.
  [FAIL] Obs vector mismatch — NN is seeing a world it wasn't trained on

  Note: Baro present. obs[8] = (alt - 0.3m) / 2.0,
  clamped to ±0.05. On table: alt≈0, so obs[8]≈-0.05 (clamped).
  This is expected — the P-altitude controller handles the rest.

